GET {{apiUrl}}/internships

###

### Expected:

### HTTP 401

### Missing authorization token.

###############################################################

### Invalid Token - List Internships

GET {{apiUrl}}/internships
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

###

### Expected:

### HTTP 401

### Invalid authentication token.

