## Update Internship (Admin or Intenship Coordinator)

###############################################################

### Coordinator Update Internship
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/internships/{{internshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"requiredHours": 250,
"startDate": "2026-09-13",
"endDate": "2026-10-30",
"hteId": "{{hteId}}",
"facultyAdviserId": "{{facultyAdviserId}}"

}

### Administrator Update Internship
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/internships/{{internshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"requiredHours": 250,
"startDate": "2026-09-13",
"endDate": "2026-10-30",
"hteId": "{{hteId}}",
"facultyAdviserId": "{{facultyAdviserId}}"

}
